4. OCF compatibility illustration
   two disjoint directed triangles with all cross edges one way: odd_cycles=2, disjoint_pairs=1, H=9, OCF=9
   reading: Faulhaber balance is linear in odd moments S_r; OCF adds
   compatibility packets alpha_k, i.e. independent collections in Omega(T).

