6. Working hypotheses generated
   H1: c=p*u+corrections with u=n(n+1) is the common triangular carrier;
       p=1,2 are integral because the Bernoulli correction vanishes.
   H2: odd Faulhaber moments are the scalar shadow of odd-cycle atoms;
       OCF suggests the missing higher structure is compatibility of atoms.
   H3: LRC14 Q27 and code72 support ledgers should retain odd atoms plus
       compatibility packets, mirroring alpha_k rather than only S_r.
   H4: HYP-2456's Beatty-Pell address is the endpoint/carry layer of the
       same carrier; the Faulhaber expansion is its moment layer.
